.cc: heap over mm pool (header-tracked, exact-class bins,\n  oversized leak-on-free), vsnprintf subset, strto*, malloc family\n- arch/x86_64: math.cc SSE float shims, timer.cc PIT TSC calibration\n- core/wasi_glue.cc: frozen preview1 profile (fd_write/proc_exit/\n  clock_time_get/random_get/args_*/environ_*/sched_yield) + per-name\n  linkage stubs with correct errnos (Go preopen scan needs EBADF);\n  generic by-result-shape stub for the rest; proc_exit traps via\n  m3Err_trapExit = clean session end\n- core/engine.cc wasm3 wrapper; core/sched.cc cooperative single-slot\n  session scheduler; kmain sniffs \\\\0asm vs VBIN payloads\n- loader path vm\\\\prog.vbin -> vm\\\\app; one disk image per gate\n  (MKDISK/RUN_QEMU macros; make test-g{1,2,3})\n- guests/: hello.wat (wat2wasm@~/.local/wabt), hello.rs\n  (wasm32v1-none target, manual wasi imports), hello.go (stock go\n  GOOS=wasip1 -- zero toolchain patching)\n- host harness tools/hosteng.cc validates guests in seconds pre-QEMU\n- allocator lessons recorded in MEMORY.md\n- gate: TEST PASS + g1/g2/g3 PASS from clean\" && git log --oneline | head -2","time":{"start":1787351004503,"end":1787351004511}},"id":"prt_0266bf4ff001qHTP8yYUdgsnLj","sessionID":"ses_fda1daed3ffeZ76o2z0rrfeMgg","messageID":"msg_0266bc0a2001jbhmDW0Tv57cJQ"}}
